The binomial coefficient \(\binom{31}{28}\) equals \(\binom{31}{3}\):

\[
\binom{31}{3} = \frac{31 \times 30 \times 29}{3!}
               = \frac{31 \times 30 \times 29}{6}
               = \frac{26970}{6}
               = 4495.
\]

Final answer: 4495.

The mixed number \(4\dfrac{5}{8}\) equals \(\frac{37}{8}\). Thus  

\[
\left(4\dfrac{5}{8}\right)^{55}\cdot\left(\frac{8}{37}\right)^{55}
= \left(\frac{37}{8}\right)^{55}\cdot\left(\frac{8}{37}\right)^{55}
= \left(\frac{37}{8}\cdot\frac{8}{37}\right)^{55}
= 1^{55}
= 1.
\]

Final answer: 1.

